{"pageProps":{"page":{"ID":1896,"post_author":"9","post_date":"November 12, 2025","post_date_gmt":"2025-11-12 23:54:55","post_title":"October 2025 Product Release","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","post_name":"october-2025-product-release","post_modified":"2025-11-13 04:22:45","post_modified_gmt":"2025-11-13 04:22:45","guid":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/?p=1896","post_type":"post","filter":"raw","url":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/resources/october-2025-product-release/","preview_type":"image","content_blocks":[{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<p>This month’s updates include expanded loan term options, appraisal status notifications, improvements to lien linking and task tracking, and a new pre-qualification API endpoint.</p>\n<p>Originators can now better meet borrower expectations, track appraisals, improve accuracy and accountability, and deliver customizable pre-qualification experiences.</p>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Expanded loan term lengths</h2>\n<p>Loan officers can now price, structure, and lock across additional loan term lengths (10, 15, and 20 years).</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Meet borrowers <strong>preferred term length needs</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Greater flexibility</strong> in loan structuring</li>\n<li>Instant pricing updates <strong>across term options</strong></li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Blog-Post-Img-Loan-term-lengths.png","alt":"Blog Post Img Product Rate Explainability","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Appraisal status notifications</h2>\n<p>LOs now receive email notifications of appraisal status changes with deep links to the specific file in the Command Center. Notifications are also available via API.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Proactive updates at appraisal <strong>order, scheduling, and completion</strong></li>\n<li><strong>On-the-go status</strong> visibility</li>\n<li><strong>Faster</strong> borrower follow-ups</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Blog-Post-Img-LO-Appraisal-Notifications.png","alt":"Blog Post Img LO Appraisal Notifications","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Lien linking for owned properties</h2>\n<p>Loan officers can now link liabilities from the credit report directly to additional owned properties outside the subject property.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Seamless linking</strong> across all owned properties</li>\n<li><strong>More accurate</strong> income and liability calculations</li>\n<li>Greater confidence when structuring <strong>complex borrower profiles</strong></li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Blog-Post-Img-Lien-Linking-Outside-Subject-Property.png","alt":"Blog Post Img Lien Linking Outside Subject Property","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Improved tracking for LO tasks</h2>\n<p>Task badges now display how long each LO-assigned task has been outstanding, overdue, or took to complete.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Smarter prioritization</strong> across active files</li>\n<li><strong>Greater accountability</strong> and self-management</li>\n<li><strong>Improved visibility</strong> for managers to track file progress</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Blog-Post-Img-LO-Task-Tracking.png","alt":"Blog Post Img LO Task Tracking","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>API improvements</h2>\n<p>New <strong>pre-qualification endpoint</strong> that delivers purchasing power without requiring a full loan application. Pre-qualification can be generated using the same few fields used for scenarios, allowing teams building to Pylon’s API to easily embed pre-qualification flows, surface purchasing power to borrowers, and create customized experiences.</p>\n"}],"related_heading":"Keep reading","related_button_label":"Read more","categories":[{"id":16,"name":"Releases","slug":"release-notes"}],"author":{"name":"Brett Byron","acf":{"profile_image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Brett.png","alt":"Brett","width":515,"height":417}}},"seo":{"title":"October 2025 Product Release - Pylon","description":"Pylon’s releases expanded loan term options, appraisal status tracking, improved lien linking and task tracking, and a new pre-qual endpoint.","image":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Blog-Post-Hero-October-Product-Release-1024x623.png"},"featured_image":{"src":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Blog-Post-Hero-October-Product-Release.png","width":760,"height":460,"alt":"Blog Post Hero October Product Release"}},"options":{"menu":{"nav_items":[{"link":{"title":"Platform","url":"/#","target":""},"has_submenu":true,"submenu_type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"grid","grid_links":[{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/loader.svg","alt":"loader","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Decisioning","url":"/decisioning","target":""},"description":"Instant credit evaluations"},{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/list.svg","alt":"list","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":fa